 "title": "【漏洞預警】VMware存在安全漏洞(CVE-2025-22224與CVE-2025-22225)，請儘速確認並進行修補",
 "source_url": "https://www.cysh.cy.edu.tw/p/406-1008-131309,r19.php",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "轉發 國家資安資訊分享與分析中心 NISAC-200-202503-00000001",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "研究人員發現VMware存在沙箱逃逸(Sandbox Escape)漏洞(CVE-2025-22224與CVE-2025-22225)，允許已取得虛擬機管理權限之攻擊者利用此漏洞於主機執行任意程式碼。該漏洞已遭駭客利用，請儘速確認並進行修補。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "情資分享等級: WHITE(情資內容為可公開揭露之資訊)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[影響平台:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● VMware ESXi 7.0與8.0版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● VMware Workstation 17.x版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● VMware Cloud Foundation 4.5.x版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● VMware Telco Cloud Platform 5.4、4.x、3.x及2x版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● VMware Telco Cloud Infrastructure 3.x與2.x版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[建議措施:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "官方已針對漏洞釋出修復更新，請參考官方說明，網址如下：",
